 "remarks": "Sited in the highly sought-after Rolling Ridge community, this condominium offers a perfect blend of updates, convenience, and tranquility. Featuring two spacious bedrooms, a newly updated kitchen, a brand-new full bath, new carpeting, updated door hardware, and fresh paint throughout. This bright and sunny, top floor single-level unit is set among Tudor-style buildings. The living area includes a living room and dining area with sliders leading to a private deck/balcony. The modern white kitchen features quartz countertops and stainless steel appliances. Additional features include brand-new air conditioning units, brand-new in-unit laundry, a storage unit in the basement, and access to the gorgeous community pool and patio area. This is truly the condo you've been waiting for, combining a peaceful setting with proximity to all your essential needs. As a practical bonus, heat and hot water are included in the common charges.",
